---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Us | Artic Power Solutions"
	description="Artic Power Solutions supplies compatible replacement batteries for Appleton RollMover™ and CartMover™ equipment, matched by part number and shipped nationwide."
	heading="About Artic Power Solutions"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
>
	<main>
		<section>
			<p>
				Artic Power Solutions supplies compatible replacement batteries for Appleton RollMover™
				roll pushers and CartMover™ cart tuggers. When a mover starts dying mid-shift, the battery
				is usually the reason, and getting a replacement shouldn't mean a long wait or an OEM price.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Why We Started</h2>
			<p>
				We kept seeing the same problem: a plant's mover was mechanically fine, but its battery
				was worn out, and replacing the original pack was expensive and slow. That left working
				equipment parked and operators pushing heavy rolls and carts by hand.
			</p>
			<p>
				We started Artic Power Solutions to offer a straightforward alternative: compatible packs,
				matched to the Appleton part number on the battery you're replacing, shipped quickly anywhere
				in the US.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>What We Offer</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<strong>Replacement battery packs by part number:</strong> Packs for Appleton
					<a href="/parts/appleton-139082-battery">#139082 (36V RollMover™)</a>,
					<a href="/parts/appleton-137819-battery">#137819 (24V CartMover™)</a> and
					<a href="/parts/appleton-143242-battery">#143242 (24V CartMover™, NiMH)</a>.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>NiCd and NiMH options:</strong> Stay with the original chemistry, or choose
					NiMH where it's offered for more runtime per charge.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Help matching your battery:</strong> Not sure which pack you have? Send us your
					equipment model or a photo of the label and we'll confirm the right replacement.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Nationwide shipping:</strong> Our packs are sold through
					<a href="https://moverbattery.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MoverBattery</a>, our battery
					store, and in-stock packs ship UPS Ground.
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Our Commitment to You</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<strong>The right fit:</strong> Every pack is matched to a specific Appleton part number,
					so you know what you're getting before you order.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Fair value:</strong> A cost-effective alternative to original replacement packs.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Straight answers:</strong> If we don't have a pack for your unit, we'll tell you.
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<p>
			Have a question about your equipment? <a href="#contact">Get in touch</a>. We're happy to help.
		</p>
	</main>
</Layout>

